  "details": "Vrchat is a 13+ game and very much important in my eyes. I've seen a lot of dark and weird stuff that children should not be exposed to. If there was a way to report just for underage I feel like this would be helpful. I am 22 year old female and I've had children say they were 6 then asked me to stay bent over so they have shovel their Dick in me. It makes me very uncomfortable as a player in a public lobby. I also hear children using racist and Homophobic Slurs, and overall very inappropriate things for their age. I'm only seeing this happen with children. Is there anything you can do to help with this that would be awesome. I don't like joining lobbes and having to block over half the people in there because of this type of behaviour.",
